---
title: "Who writes each part of a period note?"
accTitle: "Live, authored, and frozen layers"
accDescr: "Bob paints the stats strip and child index at read time. A Monday review fills narrative sections. Frontmatter, fences, and the agent brief stay frozen."
config:
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 10
    nodeSpacing: 12
    wrappingWidth: 240
---
flowchart TB
  subgraph LIVE["Bob paints, never writes the note"]
    direction TB
    STRIP["`**Stats strip**<br/>Five facts, prior period, mix bars`"]
    KIDS["`**Child index**<br/>Days of the week, weeks of the quarter`"]
    DASH["`**Click a fact**<br/>Opens dash_stats pinned`"]
    CHILD["`**Click a child**<br/>Opens that period note`"]
    STRIP --> DASH
    KIDS --> CHILD
  end
  subgraph AUTH["Human or agent, Monday review"]
    direction TB
    SENT["`**One sentence**<br/>What the period was`"]
    MOVE["`**Moved / slipped**<br/>Grounded in the dailies`"]
    BET["`**Next bet**<br/>One outcome`"]
    SENT --> MOVE --> BET
  end
  subgraph FROZEN["Template owns, nobody rewrites"]
    direction TB
    FM["`**Frontmatter**<br/>parent, type, date, id`"]
    FENCE["`**Empty fences**<br/>bob-stats-strip and index`"]
    BRIEF["`**Agent brief**<br/>HTML comment in the file`"]
    FM --> FENCE --> BRIEF
  end
  LIVE -->|"numbers inform"| AUTH
  BRIEF -.->|"prompt for"| SENT
  classDef focus fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#3B78C2,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0F2E52
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  classDef muted fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#6B7280,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1F2937
  classDef proposed stroke-dasharray:5 3
  class STRIP,KIDS,DASH,CHILD focus
  class SENT,MOVE,BET outcome
  class FM,FENCE,BRIEF muted
  class SENT,MOVE,BET proposed
  style LIVE fill:none,stroke:#3B78C2
  style AUTH fill:none,stroke:#2E7D4F
  style FROZEN fill:none,stroke:#6B7280
